      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Center of gravity is critical, so aim to balance heavy items evenly across each tier. Interlock by alternating the direction of each pallet, so gravity doesn't pull them off, and keep the stacks' weight low by using high-density racks to minimize sway. Regularly inspect the load and make sure it doesn't shift beyond 15 degrees for stability. Remember, larger loads require wider interlocks and sometimes spread decks for better distribution.",
